{"id":70550,"date":"2026-10-23T16:25:25","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T15:25:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70550"},"modified":"2026-10-23T16:44:39","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T15:44:39","slug":"lisbon-eco-marathon","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/lisbon-eco-marathon\/","title":{"rendered":"Lisbon Eco Marathon 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Lisbon Eco Marathon 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Lisbon Eco Marathon 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>11 de abril de 2027<\/strong> (domingo), com partidas e chegadas instaladas na <strong>Alameda Cardeal Cerejeira (Alto do Parque Eduardo VII)<\/strong>, em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o da cidade de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Organizado pelo <strong>Clube Desportivo e Recreativo Chronos<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Arriaga, Pinto &amp; Leite, Lda.<\/strong>, este evento de refer\u00eancia une o ambiente urbano lisboeta aos trilhos naturais do <strong>Parque Florestal de Monsanto<\/strong>, sob um rigoroso compromisso de eco-responsabilidade e preserva\u00e7\u00e3o ambiental.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Limitada a um m\u00e1ximo global de <strong>3.000 vagas<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o integra quatro dist\u00e2ncias de etapa \u00fanica: a <strong>Maratona (42 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong>, a <strong>Meia Maratona (21 km)<\/strong> com tiro de partida \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong>, a <strong>Mini Maratona (12 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada (8 km)<\/strong> com in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong>10:15<\/strong>. Os percursos contam com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, abastecimentos estrat\u00e9gicos sem copos descart\u00e1veis, servi\u00e7o de bengaleiro e um tempo limite global de <strong>6h00<\/strong> (encerramento da meta \u00e0s <strong>14:30<\/strong> e barreira hor\u00e1ria \u00e0s <strong>13:30<\/strong> no \u00faltimo posto a 5 km da chegada).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O levantamento do kit de atleta (t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial S a XXL, dorsal com chip e pulseira de bengaleiro) decorre na tenda instalada junto \u00e0 Bandeira Nacional, no Alto do Parque Eduardo VII, no s\u00e1bado (10 de abril, das <strong>10:00 \u00e0s 19:00<\/strong>) e no domingo (11 de abril, a partir das <strong>07:00<\/strong>). Todos os finalistas das provas competitivas recebem uma lembran\u00e7a exclusiva de finisher e diploma digital, com cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dio prevista para as <strong>12:30<\/strong> para distinguir os 3 primeiros classificados gerais masculinos e femininos e a maior equipa. Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">11 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Alameda Cardeal