ackground: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 9.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 11.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11\/2026 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01\/2027 a 22\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (23\/03\/2027 a 31\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">5\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/04\/2027 a 08\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Lisbon Eco Marathon 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Lisbon Eco Marathon 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 11 de abril de 2027, com partida e chegada na Alameda Cardeal Cerejeira (Alto do Parque Eduardo VII), em Lisboa, desenvolvendo-se pelos trilhos do Parque Florestal de Monsanto.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida de cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Maratona (42 km) parte \u00e0s 08:30 (abertura de box \u00e0s 07:45), a Meia Maratona (21 km) parte \u00e0s 09:30 (box \u00e0s 08:45), a Mini Maratona (12 km) parte \u00e0s 10:00 (box \u00e0s 09:45) e a Caminhada (8 km) inicia-se \u00e0s 10:15 (box \u00e0s 10:05).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o divididas em 5 fases at\u00e9 8 de abril de 2027: Maratona (41 \u20ac a 65 \u20ac), Meia Maratona (22 \u20ac a 40 \u20ac), Mini Maratona 12 km (14 \u20ac a 30 \u20ac) e Caminhada 8 km (9 \u20ac a 20 \u20ac, gratuita at\u00e9 aos 8 anos). Existe ainda a op\u00e7\u00e3o de Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Premium (+28 \u20ac at\u00e9 15 de mar\u00e7o de 2027) com almo\u00e7o e massagem desportiva.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona numa tenda junto \u00e0 Bandeira Nacional, na Alameda Cardeal Cerejeira (Alto do Parque Eduardo VII), no s\u00e1bado, 10 de abril de 2027, das 10:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, 11 de abril, a partir das 07:00 at\u00e9 \u00e0 hora de partida.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e que material \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio levar?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de 6h00 (encerramento da meta \u00e0s 14:30), existindo uma barreira hor\u00e1ria \u00e0s 13:30 no \u00faltimo abastecimento (a cerca de 5 km da meta). Como n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos nos abastecimentos, cada atleta deve transportar copo ou recipiente reutiliz\u00e1vel e reserva de \u00e1gua.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"